WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:05.009
Another thing that Dr. Bright is not allowed
to do at the SCP Foundation: Make up jodies

00:00:05.009 --> 00:00:09.680
for Morning Calisthenics, including, of course,
the Mickey Mouse Club House song.

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:13.580
In Military parlance, jodies are a name for
the chants performed while marching to keep

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:16.000
the soldiers in time and boost morale.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.230
These can be extremely helpful for military
marches, but not for the group calisthenics

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:22.910
being performed in the Foundation gym.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:27.999
Certain employees, who chose to remain anonymous
in their HR Reports, described this as “annoying”

00:00:27.999 --> 00:00:31.900
and “distracting”, especially when Dr.
Bright chose to sing the Mickey Mouse Club

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:32.900
House song.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:38.290
Dr. Clef, who did not wish to remain anonymous,
said, “If I have to hear that stupid song

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:42.980
one more time when I’m trying to get my
morning reps in, I’m shoving that goofy

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:47.070
medallion where the sun don’t shine.”

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:51.790
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: Dr. Bright is not

00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:56.720
allowed to interact with Dr. Clef without
the presence of a responsible administrator.

00:00:56.720 --> 00:01:00.900
After an ordinary lunch meeting between the
two Doctors resulted in a dozen casualties,

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:04.909
several containment breaches, and a glob of
mashed potatoes stuck to the ceiling that

00:01:04.909 --> 00:01:08.630
won’t budge no matter how hard the cleaning
staff scrubs, it was decided that the two

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:11.960
should not be in the same room without adequate
supervision.

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:16.030
There have been some follow-up questions (mainly
from Bright and Clef) about who counts as

00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:21.030
adequate supervision, so let’s clarify:
Dr. Kondraki does not count.

00:01:21.030 --> 00:01:23.100
Agent Strelnikov does not count.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:25.180
Dr. Mann does not count.

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:26.880
So far, no one counts.

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:28.550
As soon as someone does count?

00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:30.170
Trust us, you’ll know.

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:32.510
Don’t call us, we’ll call you.

00:01:32.510 --> 00:01:38.140
A Friendly Reminder to All Foundation Staff
- Dr. Bright is NOT: A superhero of any sort,

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:42.660
Head of Public Relations, in charge of Orientation
for new staff, a doctor of psychology, a member

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:48.030
of Site Command, made out of bacon, in possession
of an IQ over 300, Head of SCP Review, or

00:01:48.030 --> 00:01:53.080
a member of Maintenance Staff - Sorry boys,
Dr. Bright IS a member of Site Command.

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:55.100
It's usually best not to ask why.

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:57.490
It's O5 Command you're thinking of.

00:01:57.490 --> 00:02:01.080
Given that he’s constantly taking other
people’s bodies to propagate himself, it’s

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:06.200
no surprise that Dr. Bright might be a little
prone to the occasional identity crisis.

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:11.290
This is, however, no excuse for him to confuse
others - though especially new recruits - by

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:15.510
claiming to have seemingly every title under
the sun except his own.

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:20.450
Possessing the body of a doctor of psychology
does not mean the title passes to you, Dr.

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:21.450
Bright.

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:22.450
This isn’t Highlander.

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:26.981
Another Thing That Dr. Bright Is Not Allowed
to do At the SCP Foundation: Dr. Bright is

00:02:26.981 --> 00:02:32.050
not allowed anywhere near a Renaissance Festival,
especially not with D-class in garb.

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:36.590
The SCP Foundation has some of the most high-tech
equipment you’ve ever seen - Or rather,

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:37.710
never seen.

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:41.330
After all, they’re working with unimaginable
supernatural power, and they need the very

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:44.980
cutting edge in technology to keep all these
anomalous powers contained.

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:49.390
But of course, this can make Foundation employees
long for a simpler time.

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:53.780
However, that’s no excuse for Dr. Bright
to lead a band of D-Classes in medieval garb

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:58.340
- Many of which, by the way, are convicted
killers - to a local Ren Faire.

00:02:58.340 --> 00:03:03.140
This has, on multiple occasions, led to fires,
assaults, property damage, and death - Some

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:07.420
of which came from curious Ren Faire attendants
touching Dr. Bright’s medallion to see if

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:08.660
it was real.

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:13.879
Naturally, the Foundation isn’t eager to
see this kind of history repeat itself.

00:03:13.879 --> 00:03:18.690
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: Dr. Bright is not

00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:21.349
allowed to bargain with personnel for their
"souls."

00:03:21.349 --> 00:03:23.550
Not even if he can get them a good deal.

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:30.140
Dr. Bright is believed to have a longstanding
relationship with SCP-1879, the Indoor Salesman,

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:34.490
and while you didn’t hear this from us,
rumor has it that the salesman has promised

00:03:34.490 --> 00:03:39.490
Dr. Bright an extremely rare Pokemon card
if he can give him ten human souls.

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:43.160
And Dr. Bright really, really wants that Pokemon
card.

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:47.940
The O5 Council officially decries this action
and requests that any attempts at soul-bartering

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:52.160
perpetrated by Dr. Bright be reported to them
immediately.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:56.810
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: He is not allowed

00:03:56.810 --> 00:03:59.410
to make himself the King of anywhere.

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:00.830
Or Queen!

00:04:00.830 --> 00:04:05.770
Thanks to his SCP-963 necklace, Dr. Bright
can steal the bodies of pretty much any non-anomalous

00:04:05.770 --> 00:04:09.370
being - including powerful heads of states
and monarchs.

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:13.750
This would definitely be a sweet gig for Dr.
Bright, who could kick back and enjoy all

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:15.409
the benefits of royalty.

00:04:15.409 --> 00:04:19.180
The problem is, the Foundation needs him to
work for them, and if ever the necklace is

00:04:19.180 --> 00:04:21.870
removed from the ruler, they’ll just drop
dead.

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:26.020
So it’s best to keep Dr. Bright away from
anyone in a position of power when he’s

00:04:26.020 --> 00:04:28.560
in one of his more capricious moods.

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:33.250
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: Dr. Bright must be

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:37.810
reminded that the Better Business Bureau is
not the correct agency for dealing with containment

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:41.650
failures from horrible eldritch artifacts
sold by Marshall, Carter, and Dark.

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:46.500
Marshall, Carter, and Dark exist at the frightening
intersection of dark, anomalous power and

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:47.740
unfettered capitalism.

00:04:47.740 --> 00:04:51.340
They’re one of the most powerful groups
of interest out there, with almost unlimited

00:04:51.340 --> 00:04:55.410
funds and an utterly ruthless desire to profit
at all costs.

00:04:55.410 --> 00:05:00.050
The Better Business Bureau are utterly toothless
against a group of their sheer, unrelenting

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:01.050
power.

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:03.300
They can grease any palm and snap any neck.

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:07.110
The poor, lowly BBB would not be able to land
a hit on them.

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:11.820
The IRS, on the other hand, is a completely
different story…

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:16.449
Another Thing Dr. Bright Is Not Allowed To
Do At The SCP Foundation: Challenge anyone

00:05:16.449 --> 00:05:20.199
to a duel and then give them SCP-572.

00:05:20.199 --> 00:05:24.350
Challenging other Foundation personnel to
a duel is a terrible idea at the best of times

00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:29.490
- That’s how we lost Dr. Hamilton - but
it becomes especially farcical with SCP-572.

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:34.810
572 is a shoddy and poorly weighted katana
that, to anyone using it, appears to be a

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:39.800
blade of awesome power, that drives them to
perform ill-considered and dangerous stunts.

00:05:39.800 --> 00:05:44.199
These often result in the injury of themselves
or others until the sword is taken from them,

00:05:44.199 --> 00:05:45.610
or they’re knocked out.

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:49.990
It causes major headaches for the Foundation
whenever it’s used, but of course, Dr. Bright

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:52.169
thinks it’s hi-larious.

00:05:52.169 --> 00:05:56.699
Another Thing That Doctor Bright is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: He’s no longer

00:05:56.699 --> 00:06:00.460
allowed to challenge Able to unwinnable games
like tic-tac-toe.

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:03.310
It was three weeks before Able conceded a
draw.

00:06:03.310 --> 00:06:08.430
It probably shouldn’t surprise you that
Able, legendary swordsman and component of

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:13.280
SCP-076, both takes himself very seriously
and has a bit of a competitive streak.

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:17.479
That’s why Dr. Bright enjoys getting under
his skin by challenging him to pointless and

00:06:17.479 --> 00:06:21.680
unwinnable games like tic-tac-toe, just to
watch him get steamed.

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:26.180
The problem is, when Able gets steamed, there
tends to be a large amount of collateral damage.

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:28.260
That’s why, during containment breaches.

00:06:28.260 --> 00:06:32.960
Dr. Bright is advised to keep himself and
his snakes and ladders board well away from

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:34.860
the affected area.

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:39.750
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: Attempting to disprove

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:41.699
343, to 343.

00:06:41.699 --> 00:06:44.020
It’s a horrible idea.

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:48.639
Agents are still studying the resulting paperweight,
supposedly so heavy that 343 should not be

00:06:48.639 --> 00:06:49.699
able to lift it.

00:06:49.699 --> 00:06:53.660
For context, while debate around the truth
of this matter rages among Foundation staff

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:59.110
and in our comment sections, SCP-343 is a
reality-warping anomaly that refers to itself

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:03.449
as God - believed to be omnipresent, omniscient,
and omnipotent.

00:07:03.449 --> 00:07:07.539
A classic thought experiment on the possibility
of this is whether God is capable of creating

00:07:07.539 --> 00:07:11.400
an object they themself couldn’t lift - resulting
in a paradox.

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:16.400
Or, in this case, an astronomically heavy
paperweight that the SCP Foundation now needs

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:17.650
to deal with.

00:07:17.650 --> 00:07:18.920
Thanks, Jack.

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:23.280
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: No ending reports

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:26.090
with lyrics from "The Fresh Prince of Bel-Air".

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:30.460
Sometimes work at the SCP Foundation can get
a bit grueling, so Dr. Bright tries to “brighten”

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:33.190
everyone’s day with a little pop culture
reference or two.

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:38.720
However, after a report on SCP-096’s potential
origins concluded with “In West of the Arctic,

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:42.009
born and raised, in the mountains is where
he spent most of his days.”

00:07:42.009 --> 00:07:44.210
His colleagues agreed that enough was enough.

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:48.310
However, after he submitted a formal request,
he was given certain allowances.

00:07:48.310 --> 00:07:52.699
Mainly, he can use lyrics from Safety Dance,
as the majority of the research staff still

00:07:52.699 --> 00:07:53.950
find them funny.

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:58.690
Most notably, he ended a report on SCP-049
with: “You can cure if you want to, you

00:07:58.690 --> 00:08:00.540
can leave your friends behind.

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:05.030
Cause your friends got plague and if they’ve
got plague then they’re no friends of mine!”

00:08:05.030 --> 00:08:08.069
After his accompanying dance nearly broke
a window and triggered a containment breach

00:08:08.069 --> 00:08:12.819
of SCP-173, however, his boogying privileges
were revoked.

00:08:12.819 --> 00:08:16.169
Another Thing Doctor Bright is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation:

00:08:16.169 --> 00:08:20.830
Dr. Bright is not allowed to feed anything
with peanut butter to Kain.

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:24.860
And no, we don’t mean SCP-073, that’s
Cain with a C.

00:08:24.860 --> 00:08:30.330
This is Dr. Kain Pathos Crow, a legendary
SCP Foundation researcher who, through some

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:35.289
anomalous accident, got turned into a dog
with human-level intelligence and ability.

00:08:35.289 --> 00:08:39.669
Dr. Bright is no stranger to being an animal
thanks to his body-swapping necklace, so he

00:08:39.669 --> 00:08:43.909
may want to treat his colleague to a nice
spoonful of peanut butter as an act of solidarity

00:08:43.909 --> 00:08:47.949
- After all, peanut butter without xylitol
is safe for dogs to eat.

00:08:47.949 --> 00:08:52.850
But no matter how funny Dr. Bright thinks
it is, the O5 Council is not amused by the

00:08:52.850 --> 00:08:57.579
constant sounds of Dr. Crow trying to lick
peanut butter off the roof of his mouth during

00:08:57.579 --> 00:08:59.079
staff meetings.

00:08:59.079 --> 00:09:03.610
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: No handing out instances

00:09:03.610 --> 00:09:07.529
of SCP-437 as weaponry to unsuspecting new
researchers.

00:09:07.529 --> 00:09:12.069
Dr. Bright has a real taste for Mischief,
bloodshed, and root beer floats, or, as he

00:09:12.069 --> 00:09:14.579
calls them, the three major food groups.

00:09:14.579 --> 00:09:18.899
New researchers at the Foundation, with their
difficulty recognizing sarcasm, often find

00:09:18.899 --> 00:09:21.819
themselves in the crosshairs of his goofier
moods.

00:09:21.819 --> 00:09:25.790
Well one of his cruelest jokes of all time,
however, is introducing new researchers to

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:29.029
SCP-437 without any kind of warning.

00:09:29.029 --> 00:09:33.139
Imagine starting a new job, and meeting someone
of a higher rank than you that you think you

00:09:33.139 --> 00:09:34.139
can trust.

00:09:34.139 --> 00:09:38.149
This person tells you to check out a specialized
weapon, and when you do, you find trees that

00:09:38.149 --> 00:09:42.399
have disturbingly human faces in their bark,
sap made from blood, and the muffled sound

00:09:42.399 --> 00:09:44.519
of agonized screaming emanating from within.

00:09:44.519 --> 00:09:48.649
Dr. Bright has been formally censured for
this behavior, and warned that if it continues,

00:09:48.649 --> 00:09:52.440
he will be responsible for covering all resulting
therapy bills.

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:56.720
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: No leading a Mobile

00:09:56.720 --> 00:10:00.759
Task Force against the UIU under any circumstances!

00:10:00.759 --> 00:10:05.290
The Unusual Incidents Unit of the FBI is a
generally well-meaning, but often irritating

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:07.709
presence in the world of anomalous research.

00:10:07.709 --> 00:10:11.980
It’s the annoying little brother who insists
on following you and your friends around when

00:10:11.980 --> 00:10:14.480
you’re trying to play big boy games, for
crying out loud!

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:18.920
But that doesn’t mean that it’s acceptable
to lead a Mobile Task Force against them.

00:10:18.920 --> 00:10:22.670
With Bright’s newly formed task force, he
approached a UIU building and proceeded to

00:10:22.670 --> 00:10:26.800
order a series of “ding dong ditches,”
wherein task force members would ring the

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:30.149
doorbell and then run away laughing before
anyone could catch them.

00:10:30.149 --> 00:10:34.529
They also covered the exterior of the building
in eggs, toilet paper, and a substance later

00:10:34.529 --> 00:10:37.990
revealed to be a lightly radioactive form
of silly string.

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:42.759
Though no real damage was done, this behavior
was described by the O5 Council as “just

00:10:42.759 --> 00:10:43.759
kind of mean?”

00:10:43.759 --> 00:10:48.339
Dr. Bright has been prohibited from leading
any more Task Forces in the future.

00:10:48.339 --> 00:10:53.070
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: He should not replace

00:10:53.070 --> 00:10:58.449
the buckshot in Dr. Clef's shotgun shells
with any of the following: birdseed, confetti,

00:10:58.449 --> 00:11:00.850
cake sprinkles, sawdust, or glitter.

00:11:00.850 --> 00:11:05.379
Being a loose-cannon, ex-GOC operative, it
goes without saying that Dr. Clef loves his

00:11:05.379 --> 00:11:09.339
shotgun, and during containment breaches,
he’s the first to charge in with said shotgun

00:11:09.339 --> 00:11:11.439
and face down his anomalous enemies.

00:11:11.439 --> 00:11:15.819
However, as funny as Dr. Bright thinks it
may be, he really shouldn’t replace Dr.

00:11:15.819 --> 00:11:18.980
Clef’s buckshot with any number of amusing,
harmless alternatives.

00:11:18.980 --> 00:11:24.870
While seeing SCP-682 get a face full of cake
sprinkles certainly is something, if Dr. Clef

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:28.339
needs to spend another week in traction as
a result of it, he’s going to have some

00:11:28.339 --> 00:11:30.750
serious words for Dr. Bright.

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:35.249
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: No sending Nigerian

00:11:35.249 --> 00:11:39.079
Prince-esque spam emails to the Church of
the Broken God!

00:11:39.079 --> 00:11:44.179
Email is a vital communication tool to keep
any workplace running smoothly, even the SCP

00:11:44.179 --> 00:11:45.179
Foundation!

00:11:45.179 --> 00:11:48.179
However, like any great tool, it can also
be used for evil.

00:11:48.179 --> 00:11:49.829
Or just a bit of chaos.

00:11:49.829 --> 00:11:54.540
Dr. Bright decided to play a prank, and earn
a bit of extra cash, by posing as a sentient

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:57.389
machine in need of help from the Church of
the Broken God.

00:11:57.389 --> 00:12:00.269
“Pls respond…need 100,000 US Dollars to
fight against the Sarkites…for the glory

00:12:00.269 --> 00:12:10.129
of Mekhane…send ur routing number and bank
information ASAP.”

00:12:10.129 --> 00:12:14.110
The Church quickly wired the money, and were
enraged when they learned they had been duped.

00:12:14.110 --> 00:12:18.929
They retaliated by leaving flaming bags of
dog poop on the front steps of several Foundation

00:12:18.929 --> 00:12:19.929
Sites.

00:12:19.929 --> 00:12:24.699
Needless to say, Dr. Bright has been encouraged
to find another outlet for his more mischievous

00:12:24.699 --> 00:12:25.699
impulses.

00:12:25.699 --> 00:12:27.299
They did keep the money though.

00:12:27.299 --> 00:12:32.180
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: Dr. Bright must be

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:36.299
informed that SCP-018 is not to be taunted!

00:12:36.299 --> 00:12:40.910
SCP-018 is also known as the Super Ball, and
it’s a small rubber ball created by the

00:12:40.910 --> 00:12:45.679
Wham-O corporation, with the frightening and
destructive ability to bounce higher and faster

00:12:45.679 --> 00:12:49.529
every single time it bounces, resulting in
rampant chaos.

00:12:49.529 --> 00:12:54.459
So naturally, Dr. Bright has, on occasion,
gotten it out of containment to try bouncing

00:12:54.459 --> 00:12:58.980
it around, likely destroying large amounts
of Foundation office equipment and terrorizing

00:12:58.980 --> 00:13:01.069
all nearby staff members.

00:13:01.069 --> 00:13:05.980
As such, his privileges around the Super Ball
have been revoked, and the O5 Council has

00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:11.350
advised that Dr. Bright sticks to a simple,
non-anomalous paddle ball instead.

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:16.149
Another Thing Dr. Bright Is Not Allowed To
Do at the SCP Foundation: If a mind-controlling

00:13:16.149 --> 00:13:19.399
SCP is discovered, it is to be turned over
to the proper authorities.

00:13:19.399 --> 00:13:23.350
It is not to be used to advance himself or
others higher in the Foundation.

00:13:23.350 --> 00:13:26.879
Look, we’ve all wanted to be more persuasive
people.

00:13:26.879 --> 00:13:30.329
Maybe it’s about getting a new job, or a
raise, or convincing your buddies to see the

00:13:30.329 --> 00:13:34.839
movie you want to see at the theater, rather
than the Steven Segal movies they always insist

00:13:34.839 --> 00:13:35.839
on.

00:13:35.839 --> 00:13:39.680
But Dr. Bright using mind-controlling SCPs
to help advance himself at the Foundation,

00:13:39.680 --> 00:13:44.619
or making Dr. Kondraki pee his pants so that
he can take his projects while Kondraki is

00:13:44.619 --> 00:13:49.059
put on mandatory mental health leave, is simply
not acceptable professional conduct.

00:13:49.059 --> 00:13:52.389
Isn’t Dr. Bright anomalously powerful enough
already?

00:13:52.389 --> 00:13:56.079
We really don’t need him gaining the power
to control the human mind.

00:13:56.079 --> 00:13:58.299
It just won’t end well.

00:13:58.299 --> 00:14:03.350
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: Don't let Dr. Bright

00:14:03.350 --> 00:14:05.959
get a sample of SCP-379.

00:14:05.959 --> 00:14:08.980
Let my laptop be the last victim.

00:14:08.980 --> 00:14:13.410
SCP-379 is a clear liquid nicknamed the Mechanical
Pheremone.

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:18.209
Once applied, any machines in its proximity
will begin to act as though they’re sentient,

00:14:18.209 --> 00:14:23.689
infatuated beings, including overheating,
slower response time, a preference in contact

00:14:23.689 --> 00:14:26.069
with the wearer, and a higher rate of glitches.

00:14:26.069 --> 00:14:30.980
Dr. Bright may think it’s funny to spritz
a little SCP-379 and take a walk through one

00:14:30.980 --> 00:14:36.660
of Site-19’s IT wings, but Technical Director
Rosen ardently disagrees.

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:42.620
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: SCP-963 is not to

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:46.209
be used for recreational or procreational
purposes.

00:14:46.209 --> 00:14:50.759
Well, uh, this one leaves a frightening amount
open to interpretation.

00:14:50.759 --> 00:14:55.480
SCP-963 is Dr. Bright’s medallion which
houses his consciousness and can pass it on

00:14:55.480 --> 00:14:56.499
to others.

00:14:56.499 --> 00:15:01.059
If ever it remains connected to one body for
over thirty days, it leaves a permanent copy

00:15:01.059 --> 00:15:05.319
inside the body, meaning Dr. Bright could
theoretically make clones of himself.

00:15:05.319 --> 00:15:09.829
He’s generally not allowed to do the latter
under any circumstances, but especially if

00:15:09.829 --> 00:15:14.639
the plan is to, say, use the copy to do menial
chores or stand in for him at more boring

00:15:14.639 --> 00:15:17.940
meetings while Dr. Bright plays solitaire
in his office.

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:21.790
And they definitely wouldn’t tolerate Dr.
Bright committing any…

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:23.050
Um…

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:24.309
Onanism…

00:15:24.309 --> 00:15:27.730
With his clones, thank you very much.

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:33.040
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: No using SCPs to

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:37.389
create tentacle monsters - even if Dr. Palmer
asks nicely!

00:15:37.389 --> 00:15:41.050
There are a vast number of anomalous technologies
that would allow a bored Dr. Bright to try

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:46.269
his hand at playing god with some genetic
engineering - Including, in theory, creating

00:15:46.269 --> 00:15:47.290
tentacle monsters.

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:51.861
This may seem innocent enough, but due to
certain Japanese censorship laws, tentacle

00:15:51.861 --> 00:15:54.929
monsters have taken on a whole new meaning.

00:15:54.929 --> 00:15:58.860
Especially to one of Dr. Bright’s colleagues,
Dr. Palmer, who’ll happily tell you about

00:15:58.860 --> 00:16:03.679
her favorite anime: “My Husband is a Tentacle
Monster In Another World.”

00:16:03.679 --> 00:16:07.709
Needless to say, the Foundation would prefer
that their employees do this kind of thing

00:16:07.709 --> 00:16:09.029
at home.

00:16:09.029 --> 00:16:13.850
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: Dr. Bright may not

00:16:13.850 --> 00:16:17.910
use any form of the word 'accident' as an
excuse.

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:21.040
We get it, Dr. Bright, real accidents do happen.

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:23.339
Nobody is perfect, least of all, you.

00:16:23.339 --> 00:16:27.120
But considering some of the complexity of
the antics you’ve been up to lately, we

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:31.769
find it extremely hard to believe that you
did it all by accident.

00:16:31.769 --> 00:16:37.079
Did you accidentally slip and program “Dr.
Clef’s Pee” into SCP-294, and then pour

00:16:37.079 --> 00:16:40.559
it into Dr. Kondraki’s briefcase, so that
the two would fight each other?

00:16:40.559 --> 00:16:44.759
You’re really beginning to stretch the suspension
of disbelief here…

00:16:44.759 --> 00:16:49.120
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: Dr. Bright should

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:54.499
be reminded that victims of SCP-217 are not
toys, nor are they to be used as props at

00:16:54.499 --> 00:16:56.579
a Steampunk Convention.

00:16:56.579 --> 00:17:01.860
SCP-217, also known as the Clockwork Virus,
is a terrifying anomalous pathogen that slowly

00:17:01.860 --> 00:17:06.919
converts the organic material of its victims
into analog mechanized elements, eventually

00:17:06.919 --> 00:17:10.550
leaving them looking like inoperative steampunk
nightmares.

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:14.720
Of course, Dr. Bright has no permanent body,
and thus, it wouldn’t really hold much of

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:15.779
a threat for him.

00:17:15.779 --> 00:17:19.761
Therefore, he could, in theory, start treating
the infected individuals like big, strange

00:17:19.761 --> 00:17:25.329
robotic toys, but for the sake of human decency,
the O5 Council would really, really, really

00:17:25.329 --> 00:17:27.220
prefer that he didn’t.

00:17:27.220 --> 00:17:32.039
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: Dr. Bright is not

00:17:32.039 --> 00:17:37.120
allowed to violate the SCP Foundation dress
code, nor encourage others to do so, even

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:39.130
on “Casual Fridays.”

00:17:39.130 --> 00:17:43.360
A note appended to this rule reads, “No
matter how many times you say please, Dr.

00:17:43.360 --> 00:17:47.740
Bright, we won't put any of the hats you've
been asking about into the dress code.”

00:17:47.740 --> 00:17:53.389
And the list of hats that Dr. Bright has facetiously
requested has been nothing short of impressive,

00:17:53.389 --> 00:17:58.100
including a freakishly tall, white “Doug
Dimmadome”-esque cowboy hat, and a novelty

00:17:58.100 --> 00:18:01.370
propellor hat with actual, functioning helicopter
propellors.

00:18:01.370 --> 00:18:06.240
A number of other hats he’s suggested - simple,
non-anomalous baseball caps with humorous

00:18:06.240 --> 00:18:10.460
slogans printed on them - have been deemed
to be HR violations.

00:18:10.460 --> 00:18:11.990
Sorry, Jack.

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:16.750
Another Thing That Dr. Bright Isn’t Allowed
To Do At The SCP Foundation: Pretend that

00:18:16.750 --> 00:18:19.429
SCP-963 is a joy buzzer!

00:18:19.429 --> 00:18:23.559
For those who aren’t in the know, SCP-963
is the medallion that you’ll always find

00:18:23.559 --> 00:18:29.309
on Dr. Bright’s person - It’s an indestructible
vector for his essence, his very soul.

00:18:29.309 --> 00:18:33.130
Anyone who touches it suffers immediate brain
death, and Dr. Bright’s consciousness is

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:34.770
transferred to their body.

00:18:34.770 --> 00:18:39.210
So, naturally, when Dr. Bright is feeling
mischievous, it’s not a very responsible

00:18:39.210 --> 00:18:45.110
prank to treat SCP-963 like a joy buzzer - Considering
it will kill its victims instantly.

00:18:45.110 --> 00:18:49.450
It’s like making a whoopee cushion filled
with nerve gas or a fake stick of gum that’s

00:18:49.450 --> 00:18:51.549
actually plastic explosives.

00:18:51.549 --> 00:18:56.419
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: no using SCPs to

00:18:56.419 --> 00:19:01.130
affect the outcome on American Idol, or any
other reality show competition!

00:19:01.130 --> 00:19:05.790
Previous violations of this rule have included:
showing his least favorite American Idol contestant

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:11.570
SCP-096’s face in the hope that it would
hunt him down, sneaking SCP-348 to a Hell’s

00:19:11.570 --> 00:19:16.470
Kitchen contestant, and releasing SCP-049
into the house on The Bachelorette because,

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:20.570
quote, “None of them are good enough for
Rachel, so they all deserve to die.”

00:19:20.570 --> 00:19:25.840
Dr. Bright is to be reminded that, if he cannot
stay on his best behavior and stay out of

00:19:25.840 --> 00:19:28.880
the competition, his tv privileges will be
revoked.

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:35.700
And does he really want to risk missing the
latest season of Love is Blind?

00:19:35.700 --> 00:19:40.130
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: Dr. Bright is not

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:42.809
allowed to edit the list of things he is not
allowed to do!

00:19:42.809 --> 00:19:48.240
Due to some unsubstantiated rumors perpetuated
by Dr. Bright himself, we must issue a formal

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:49.240
correction.

00:19:49.240 --> 00:19:53.480
If an SCP file says never to do something,
that is not because we are trying to control

00:19:53.480 --> 00:19:54.510
your mind.

00:19:54.510 --> 00:19:59.630
For example, warnings not to look at SCP-096’s
face are for your own protection.

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:03.500
If you would like to look at its face and
bring about your own untimely end, then that

00:20:03.500 --> 00:20:09.029
is up to you, but don’t say we didn’t
warn you.

00:20:09.029 --> 00:20:10.029
AHEM!

00:20:10.029 --> 00:20:11.250
No, we are not.

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:13.000
Dr. Bright, I see you.

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:17.710
You can’t type into this script any more,
your IP address has already been blocked!

00:20:17.710 --> 00:20:22.059
In conclusion, if he would let us get our
work done for once in his miserable endless

00:20:22.059 --> 00:20:27.290
life, Dr. Bright is not allowed to attempt
any manipulation, mind control, or subterfuge

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:31.659
of any kind via official SCP Foundation documents.

00:20:31.659 --> 00:20:36.440
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: Telling new researchers

00:20:36.440 --> 00:20:41.260
that you can tame SCP-682 with a rolled-up
newspaper and a tummy rub.

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:45.289
When you’ve been alive for as long as Dr.
Bright, with the knowledge of eternity stretching

00:20:45.289 --> 00:20:49.970
out before you, you can watch every movie
and show, play every game, and read every

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:50.970
book.

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:54.750
That’s why Dr. Bright sometimes resorts
to more esoteric methods of amusement.

00:20:54.750 --> 00:21:00.140
Such as feeding the newbies little white lies
about anomalies, like telling them SCP-682

00:21:00.140 --> 00:21:04.720
can be tamed with a rolled-up newspaper and
tummy rubs, like a misbehaving puppy.

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:09.480
Which must have seemed really funny until
six new researchers got devoured.

00:21:09.480 --> 00:21:14.000
And considering what a nightmare employee
turnaround is at the SCP Foundation already,

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:18.720
losing employees for a reason this stupid
really didn’t sit well with the O5 Council…

